# 🚀 Coding Guru

### Your Personal AI Coding Mentor

Coding Guru is an AI-powered coding practice platform that goes beyond traditional coding websites by acting as a real-time mentor rather than a solution provider.

Instead of simply showing answers, Coding Guru guides users through problem-solving using contextual mentoring, progressive hints, and AI-powered code reviews.

---

# 🎯 Vision

Most coding platforms focus on evaluating solutions.

Coding Guru focuses on teaching problem-solving.

The platform combines:

* 🧠 AI Mentoring
* 💡 Progressive Hinting
* 🔍 Intelligent Code Reviews
* 📝 Persistent Learning Sessions
* ⚡ Agentic Workflows powered by LangGraph

to create an interactive learning experience that adapts to each user's journey.

---

# 🏗️ System Architecture

```text
┌─────────────────────┐
│      React UI       │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│      FastAPI        │
│    API Layer        │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│     LangGraph       │
│  AI Orchestration   │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           │
     ┌─────┼─────┐
     │     │     │
     ▼     ▼     ▼
┌────────┐ ┌────────┐ ┌────────┐
│Mentor  │ │ Hint   │ │ Review │
│ Agent  │ │ Agent  │ │ Agent  │
└────┬───┘ └────┬───┘ └────┬───┘
     │          │          │
     └────┬─────┴─────┬────┘
          ▼           ▼
      SQLite      Groq LLM
```

---

# ✨ Key Features

## 🧠 AI Mentor

Users can have natural conversations while solving coding problems.

Example:

```text
User:
Can I use a HashMap here?

Mentor:
Interesting thought. What information would you store in it?
```

The mentor guides users instead of immediately revealing solutions.

---

## 💡 Progressive Hint Engine

Hints become increasingly specific based on user progress.

### Hint Level 0

```text
Can you avoid checking every pair?
```

### Hint Level 1

```text
What data structure provides O(1) lookup?
```

### Hint Level 2

```text
Consider storing previously seen values in a HashMap.
```

Each hint level is persisted and tracked per user session.

---

## 🔍 AI Code Review

Users can request reviews for their solutions.

The review agent evaluates:

* Correctness
* Time Complexity
* Space Complexity
* Optimization Opportunities
* Overall Score

Example:

```text
✓ Correctness: Likely Correct

⏱ Time Complexity: O(n)

💾 Space Complexity: O(n)

⭐ Score: 8.5/10

Suggestions:
• Good use of HashMap
• Improve variable naming
• Consider edge cases
```

---

## 💾 Persistent Learning Sessions

Each user-problem combination creates a dedicated workspace.

Coding Guru remembers:

* Saved code
* Hint progression
* Mentor conversations
* Review history
* Problem status

Users can leave and resume exactly where they left off.

---

# 🧠 Agentic AI Workflow

Coding Guru uses LangGraph to orchestrate specialized AI agents.

## Graph Flow

```text
START
  │
  ▼
Load Context
  │
  ▼
AI Router
  │
  ├───────────────┐
  │               │
  ▼               ▼
Mentor         Hint
  │               │
  │               ▼
  │          Save Message
  │
  ▼
Review
  │
  ▼
Save Review
  │
  ▼
Save Message
  │
  ▼
 END
```

---

## Context-Aware Routing

Instead of relying on keyword matching, Coding Guru uses an LLM-powered router.

Examples:

```text
"I'm stuck after the second loop"
```

➡ Routes to Hint Agent

```text
"Can you review my approach?"
```

➡ Routes to Review Agent

```text
"Can I use HashMap here?"
```

➡ Routes to Mentor Agent

---

# 🗄️ Database Design

## Sessions Table

Represents a user's workspace for a specific problem.

```text
sessions
├── user_id
├── problem_id
├── status
├── latest_code
├── hint_level
├── review_correctness
├── review_time_complexity
├── review_space_complexity
├── review_feedback
└── review_score
```

---

## Messages Table

Stores conversational memory.

```text
messages
├── session_id
├── role
├── content
└── created_at
```

This enables long-term contextual conversations across multiple sessions.

---

# 🔄 AI Context Pipeline

Before every AI interaction:

```text
User Message
      │
      ▼
Load Session
      │
      ▼
Load Problem
      │
      ▼
Load Saved Code
      │
      ▼
Load Conversation History
      │
      ▼
Build Context
      │
      ▼
Invoke LLM
      │
      ▼
Persist Response
```

This allows Coding Guru to provide highly contextual and personalized guidance.

